      "title": "Hello World — ZavyFantasiaXL (Pony / SDXL)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["## ZavyFantasiaXL - PDXL\n\n**Base:** Pony Diffusion XL (SDXL arch)\n**Tuned for:** RTX 2060 SUPER 8GB / 16GB RAM\n\n### Settings (8GB-safe)\n- 1024x1024 (SDXL native)\n- 25 steps, CFG 6.0\n- dpmpp_2m + karras\n\n### Pony prompting (IMPORTANT)\nPony models need **score tags**.\n\nPositive starts with:\n`score_9, score_8_up, score_7_up, ...`\n\nNegative starts with:\n`score_6, score_5, score_4, ...`\n\nWithout these the output quality collapses.\n\n### Model location\n```\nComfyUI/models/checkpoints/\n  zavyfantasiaxlPDXL_v20.safetensors\n```\n\nOutput auto-saves to `ComfyUI/output/`."]
,
